  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "每次死亡都会被送回随机塔顶重新开始，楼层重排让两次逃生路线不会相同",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "With each death, Von Wanst is transported back to the top of the randomly generated Tower to start again, ensuring that no two journeys are ever the same.",
