      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "西兰花、尸体等几乎任何东西都能临时抓来当武器",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "From broccoli to dead enemies, everything in the game can be used as a weapon",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1700270/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "同伴与敌人会记住你的对待方式，朋友可翻脸，受助反派也可能替你开门",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Companions and enemies react to the way you treat them - friends turn to foes if you step on their toes, and villains can open doors for you if you help them out along the way",
